courseHighlights:
  - title: NRA Basic Pistol Course & Virginia CCW Permit
    description: >-
      Get essential firearm training tips, hands-on safety drills, and complete CCW education in our most popular course—the NRA Basic Pistol & Virginia CCW Permit program. This 6-hour session combines fundamental pistol training with state-approved concealed carry certification. You'll learn practical firearm safety rules, proper handling techniques, and receive personalized firearm training tips from NRA-certified instructors, followed by supervised live fire practice.
    details: >-
      Perfect for first-time shooters seeking a Virginia concealed carry permit.
    schedule: Every Saturday
    href: /nra-basic-pistol-shooting-course
  - title: First Step Pistol Orientation & Virginia CCW
    description: >-
      Quick, targeted gun training suggestions, security basics, and CCW coaching in 3+ hours. This particular course is good for complete novices and active experts who require Virginia concealed carry permit qualification with no full-day obligation. You will learn required gun safety regulations, suitable coping strategies, and obtain useful gun training suggestions within a calm, low-stress atmosphere— + live fire training. Ideal for new shooters who desire efficient CCW training on a Thursday evening or weekend.
    details: Perfect for absolute beginners and busy professionals.
    schedule: Every Thursday
    href: /first-step-pistol-orientation
  - title: NRA CCW Advanced Pistol Course
    description: >-
      Take your skills to the next level with defensive pistol instruction
      focused on advanced techniques, tactical mindset, and real-world defensive
      scenarios.
    details: Perfect for experienced shooters and current CCW permit holders.
    href: /nra-defensive-pistol-course
  - title: One-on-One Personal Training
    description: >-
      Receive personalized firearm training tips, one-on-one safety coaching, and custom CCW education during a 60-minute private lesson. Our tailored training gives you the exact type of instruction you're looking for, such as fundamental firearm safety practice if you're a first-time shooter, skills improvement if you're an occasional shooter, or CCW education if you're booked for a CCW class. We focus on real-time drills that you can practice on your own and devote time to building a custom training plan that maximizes your time and resources.
    details: Perfect for anyone who learns best with undivided instructor attention.
    href: /one-on-one-instruction
