aboutEyebrow: About Live Fire Instruction
aboutTitle: Your Northern Virginia Resource for Firearm Training Tips, Safety & CCW Education
aboutDescription: >-
  Since 2016, Live Fire Instruction has provided unmatched firearm training
  tips, rigorous safety instruction, and state-approved CCW education to over
  7,500 students. Based at the NRA Range in Fairfax, we turn novice shooters
  into responsible, confident gun owners. Our CCW education program boasts a 98%
